      "Anaheim required recognizing that it is NOT SCE territory before doing any other research: its absence from SCE's own incorporated-cities fact sheet (despite being surrounded by SCE-territory Orange County cities) was the first clue, confirmed by Anaheim's own site naming 'Anaheim Public Utilities' as both the distribution and generation provider — a vertically-integrated municipal utility, following the same generation_supplier=utility-type pattern established for Pasadena Water and Power and Alameda Municipal Power.",
