      "For every Orange County city checked against OCPA membership (Orange, Garden Grove, Westminster, Costa Mesa, Newport Beach, Tustin, Yorba Linda, Brea), generation_supplier was left null rather than asserting non-membership, consistent with the established rule that absence from OCPA's named member list is not proof of non-membership — except where a source directly confirmed a feasibility-study/pre-launch stage (Costa Mesa) or an operational status (Huntington Beach's post-withdrawal SCE-only state, Anaheim's municipal utility)."
